WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Editing day.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.000
Read each sentence that uses and or or out loud.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.680
Ask if it’s doing the right job.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:08.830
And adds.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.650
Or offers a choice.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:18.360
And if a sentence has and, and, and, and, it’s time to cut a few and let one idea lead.
